note sexp_@T@: w[i] = f32 exp(w[i] - max) in place; returns acc (f64 bits) + the sum of the new w[i].
fn sexp_@T@ acc ulong w edit f32 @T@ mx ulong to ulong
s = bitcast f64 acc
mf = bitcast f32 uint mx
for i ulong @T@
v = f32 ex64 f64 sub get w i mf
put w i v
s = add s f64 v
end
ret bitcast ulong s
end
